{"overview":"خانواده‌ای غارنشین تا کنون از محل زندگی خود خارج نشده‌اند. پدر همیشه نگران خانواده است و اجازه خروج از غار را به آن‌ها نمی‌دهد و با تعریف کردن داستان‌های ترسناک از دنیای خارج اهل خانواده را از بیرون رفتن منع می‌کند. اما کرودها با خراب شدن غارشان مجبور می‌شوند پا به دنیایی فراتر از آنچه فکر می‌کردند و همیشه می‌دیدند بگذارند و چیزهای تازه‌ای را تجربه کنند…","tagline":"","overview_en":"The prehistoric Croods family live in a particularly dangerous moment in time. Patriarch Grug, his mate Ugga, teenage daughter Eep, son Thunk, and feisty Gran gather food by day and huddle together in a cave at night. When a more evolved caveman named Guy arrives on the scene, Grug is distrustful, but it soon becomes apparent that Guy is correct about the impending destruction of their world.","tagline_en":"The journey begins.","runtime":99,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["کریس سندرز","Kirk DeMicco"],"crew_en":["Chris Sanders","Kirk DeMicco"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"نیکولاس کیج","role":"Grug (voice)","photo":"/y1RtezurZYveYkVNRht7CwEgSYY.jpg","en":"Nicolas Cage"},{"name":"اما استون","role":"Eep (voice)","photo":"/mstXxlDqhoK0s0molsNpskJ1wLH.jpg","en":"Emma Stone"},{"name":"رایان رینولدز","role":"Guy (voice)","photo":"/trzgptffGvAlAT6MEu01fz47cLW.jpg","en":"Ryan Reynolds"},{"name":"کاترین کینر","role":"Ugga (voice)","photo":"/n4CTwGszs6cwS1wJRlDQ5Mlh7Ex.jpg","en":"Catherine Keener"},{"name":"کلوریس لیچمن","role":"Gran (voice)","photo":"/o8pnV9urjuHZDAR2u4UjPy2CR1u.jpg","en":"Cloris Leachman"},{"name":"کلارک دوک","role":"Thunk (voice)","photo":"/qL7x57avA9IupsjtwnpIuJ8p8BD.jpg","en":"Clark Duke"},{"name":"کریس سندرز","role":"Belt (voice)","photo":"/mrUm1agSL9Kj6dhV6ABVJvrwlie.jpg","en":"Chris Sanders"},{"name":"رندی تام","role":"Sandy (voice)","photo":"/oWv5U4r7NcIlQjs0IxMWE3dsx2l.jpg","en":"Randy Thom"}],"trailer":"HCLUPuu4eKk","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/49519-the-croods/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Amazon Video